","text":"アイドルとして気を付けていることとかありますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜んとねっ、皆がhappyな気持ちになってくれるように日常生活から気を付けてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもダイエットはなかなか出来ない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッゴク食べ盛りです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は腹巻きして寝るよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してないですぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでショートにしようと思ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成一年をきにバッサリ切ろうと思って50?くらい切ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンフレッチェ広島の試合見に行ったことあるんだよね？じゃぁJ1の『サガン鳥栖』っていうチーム知ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってるよ！佐賀県にあるチームだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんがサッカーしてることもあって知ってるよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは怖がり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の乃木坂ってここ！見てくださればわかると思うんですけど、怖いの大嫌いです。是非公式サイトアクセスして見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会以外にファンと一緒にできるとイベントがあるとしたらどんな企画がしたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜んなんだろ。ファンの人もみーんなで運動会とか？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまで活動していてなにか挑戦してみたいこと、やりたいことはある"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近色んなメンバーがドラマとか出てるのを見て、現役中学生だし、学園ものとかやりたいなぁ。って思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エヘヘ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月アレンジってんどんなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだっけなぁ。忘れちゃった。ごめん〜。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛されまあやの異名を持つほど人気者のまあやですが、愛される秘訣は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘訣とか全然ないけどありのままの自分でいることかなぁ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん。わかんないw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみとの面白かったエピソード教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前またママとケンカしたそうなのですが、ちょっと時間がたつと一緒にドラマ見たそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも思うけどすぐに仲直りするとこ可愛いしほんわかします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家事とかやってるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"独り暮らしで苦労したことは何"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事やりながら学業の勉強をして、そして家事をするのはなかなか大変でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近さらに仲良くなったメンバーを教えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この質問は難しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、年齢層ひろいけど、そんなの感じさせないくらい皆仲良んだよね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁこれ！っていうならせいらりんかなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこの前もオウチにお邪魔しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きはまた次回"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の質問り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の撮影の時のっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か〜ら〜の〜前のだけど夏のまあやを、ドーンッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rdなはあま←足つった！痛がって騒いでたら変なの押しちゃってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のOFFまあやの１日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここらで急に１日を書こうかと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５時→半起床\n(冷房と暖房間違えて寒すぎて若干早めに起きちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８時から夕方４時くらいまで学校！\nからの友達とちょっとご飯食べに行った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(でも家に帰ってもしっかりカボチャの入ったシチューいっぱい食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/11/13/9549270/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜９時→入浴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜10時〜11時→TVみたり携帯したり勉強したり、自由時間"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada